### Entity / DTO

```typescript
interface FeatureEntity {
  id: string;
  fieldA: string;
  fieldB: string | null;
}
```

### Persistence (Drizzle ORM)

```typescript
import { relations } from "drizzle-orm";
import { pgTable, text, timestamp } from "drizzle-orm/pg-core";

export const featureEntities = pgTable("FeatureEntity", {
  id: text("id").primaryKey(),
  fieldA: text("fieldA").notNull(),
  fieldB: text("fieldB"),
  createdAt: timestamp("createdAt", { precision: 3 }).notNull().defaultNow(),
  updatedAt: timestamp("updatedAt", { precision: 3 })
    .notNull()
    .defaultNow()
    .$onUpdate(() => new Date()),
});

export const featureEntitiesRelations = relations(featureEntities, () => ({
  // 関連エンティティを定義
}));
```

## API Contract

### Endpoint Summary

| Method | Endpoint | Purpose | Auth |
|--------|----------|---------|------|
| GET | /api/feature/:id | 取得 | 必要 |
| PATCH | /api/feature/:id | 更新 | 必要 |

### Request / Response

```typescript
type UpdateFeatureRequest = {
  fieldA: string;
  fieldB?: string | null;
};

type UpdateFeatureResponse = {
  item: FeatureEntity;
};
```

### Error Contract

| HTTP Status | Code | Meaning | Caller Behavior |
|-------------|------|---------|-----------------|
| 400 | VALIDATION_ERROR | 入力不正 | エラー表示 |
| 403 | FORBIDDEN | 権限不足 | 遷移 / ブロック |
| 404 | NOT_FOUND | データなし | エラー表示 |
| 500 | INTERNAL_ERROR | 想定外失敗 | 再試行案内 |

## State Transitions

