```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Draft: new()

    Draft --> Submitted: submit() [バリデーションOK]
    Draft --> Draft: save() [部分保存]

    Submitted --> UnderReview: startReview() [管理者ログイン]
    UnderReview --> Approved: approve()
    UnderReview --> Rejected: reject(reason)

    Rejected --> Draft: reopen()
    Approved --> [*]
```

